      "id": "subaru_uds2",
      "title": {
        "ru": "Subaru: коды UDS как 00 + код SAE",
        "en": "Subaru: UDS codes as 00 + the SAE code"
      },
      "dtc_format": "uds2",
      "family_commands": true,
      "note": "Outback BT 2.4 turbo (FA24), VIN 4S4BTGND8M3164262, 2026-10-23: 19 02 AF to 7E0 -> 59 02 7F 00 01 71 45 00 21 95 6D, while Mode 03 gave P2195 and Mode 07 P0171, P2195 (status 45 pending, 6D confirmed). The same car's VDC (7B0), climate (7C4), cockpit (7D0) and EyeSight (787) answer standard 3-byte records (54 22 00 = C1422)."
    }
  ],
